{"canonical_line_id": "cl_6f602431fee0", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00001", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-1", "stable-2"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-1", "stable-2"], "text": "止まってけ編み込みこし取ばいな止まってけみて皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社サクラプラス代表の中山です。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6722307, "updated_at": 1783964027.6722314, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_45526fcc9a0e", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00002", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-3", "stable-4"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-3", "stable-4"], "text": "本日は2026年7月期、第3四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。は二千二十六年七月期第三四半期決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高についは百三十六億七千九百万となり前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6723502, "updated_at": 1783964027.6723504, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_ecdbeaccd12b", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00003", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-5", "stable-6", "stable-7", "stable-8"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-5", "stable-6", "stable-7", "stable-8"], "text": "これは既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました一方不動産事業は前期に計上した大型不動産売却案件の反動により当期も不動産売却は実施したものの全体としては減少となりましたなお、その他サービスは概ね計画どり進捗しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6724317, "updated_at": 1783964027.6724317, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
