{"canonical_line_id": "cl_409048c501d4", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00005", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-10", "stable-11"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-10", "stable-11"], "text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七に向上経常利益は十一億二千八百万円となり前年同期比9。5の増益となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6725674, "updated_at": 1783964027.6725676, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
