{"canonical_line_id": "cl_724ec33f2f74", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00007", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-13", "stable-14"], "text": "親会社株主に属する当期純利前年度前期に計上した不採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため投機は増益となりました。続いて進捗についてお知らせいたします。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6726882, "updated_at": 1783964027.6726885, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_f3b5f29744a3", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00008", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-15"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-15"], "text": "売上高は通期予算に対して各サービス等も堅調に成長しており、当四半期累計機関におて順調に推移しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.67275, "updated_at": 1783964027.6727502, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_c1098201b7a3", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00009", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-16", "stable-17", "stable-18"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-16", "stable-17", "stable-18"], "text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し対応のない成果や不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の施策が確実に成果を創出し、収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中、これらの施策が利益の上振れをけん引し当四半期累計期間におて通期予算を前倒しして達成しました続いて貸借対照表資産の分は販売に伴う販売用不動産の検証が補助金収入による未収入金の増加", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783964027.6728134, "updated_at": 1783964027.672814, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
